{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q38", "domain": "career", "question": "命主早年一直在北京生活，直到哪个年龄有搬迁大变动，从北京去厦门工作？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "要分析命主何时从北京搬迁到厦门，需观察大运、流年与原局的互动，尤其是代表故乡的年柱、迁移的驿马星及冲合变动。\n\n命主八字：庚戌 癸未 癸卯 己未，日主癸水弱，土重，喜金水。年柱庚戌代表祖籍北京，印星坐财库。大运顺排，约5岁起运：甲申（5-14）、乙酉（15-24）、丙戌（25-34）、丁亥（35-44）、戊子（45-54）。搬迁发生在青壮年，考虑丙戌或丁亥运。\n\n丙戌运（25-34岁），财星旺，财克印，有离乡求财之象。重点看流年：\n- 1998戊寅年（28岁），寅为驿马，正官坐马，工作变动可能，但寅为东北，方向不符厦门。\n- 2000庚辰年（31虚岁，周岁30），辰戌冲，直冲年柱故乡宫，且辰为东南方，正应厦门方位。辰为水库，助旺日主，为喜神流年，庚金正印透干，主文书调令或工作变动。此年离乡迁往东南最为应象。\n- 2001辛巳年，巳为东南方马星，但巳未会火土，忌神旺，且无强力冲动，可能性次之。\n\n丁亥运（35-44岁），亥为驿马，但亥为西北方，与厦门东南不符。且换运在2005乙酉年（冲日支）或2007丁亥年（岁运并临），年份较晚，不符合“早年”即变动之意。\n\n综合方位（辰方东南）、喜用（庚辰金水喜神）、冲年柱离乡之象，2000庚辰年最契合，时年31虚岁，落入选项A（27—31岁）。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q38", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P4_G4\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 115777, "response_id": "eb7d37b3-d2ea-4eb7-af16-96082fdee9c0", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 231, "completion_tokens": 6425, "total_tokens": 6656, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5990}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 103}}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q39", "domain": "health", "question": "命主身体状况为何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，日主癸水生于未月，地支双未一戌，土重官杀旺盛，癸水无根且月干比肩虚浮，年柱庚金印星被燥土所脆，生助无力，格局身弱无疑。土重克水，易有肾气不足、精力衰退之象；日支卯木为食神，本可制杀，却反被众土耗困，形成土重木折之势。食神主思想、精神与神经系统，受克严重，必然导致长期精神压力、思虑过度、失眠多梦、神经衰弱等问题。七杀攻身无制，心性易惊惶不安，精神长期处于疲惫状态。此组合非外来的突发意外，而是内在体质与精神系统的慢性失调，故以长期失眠、精神不济最为相符。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q39", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P4_G4\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 56202, "response_id": "9cadf3d4-fa50-499b-b7ad-2be23f163080", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 2962, "total_tokens": 3189, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2775}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}}
